{
  "about": "The songs the app can suggest for a day. Each entry is { title, artist, lang, moods, topics }. lang is bn (Bengali), hi (Hindi) or en (English). moods are feeling ids from feelings.json (how the day felt); topics are topic ids from topics.json (what it was about). A day is matched to songs that share its feeling (most weight) and its topic, with a little chance so the same day does not always give the same three. Add, remove or retag songs freely; the tests only check that the ids exist and every feeling has a few songs. Only titles and artists are kept here: nothing is played inside the app, a song opens as a search on Spotify or YouTube.",
